{"step_index":215,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:04:40Z","thinking":"**Confirming `test_min_le` Proof**\n\nThe proof for `test_min_le` is confirmed. The result is kernel-checked, indicating a successful proof within the constraints of the specified dependencies. This demonstrates the theorem's validity.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\\n\\ntheorem minCard_le {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (p : Finset V → Prop) [DecidablePred p] (s : Finset V) (hs : p s) :\\n    GraphCalc.minCard p ≤ s.card := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.minCard\\n  let img := ((Finset.univ.powerset.filter p).image Finset.card)\\n  have h_mem : s.card ∈ img := by\\n    apply Finset.mem_image.mpr\\n    refine ⟨s, ?_, rfl⟩\\n    apply Finset.mem_filter.mpr\\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_powerset.mpr (Finset.subset_univ s), hs⟩\\n  have h_min_le : img.min ≤ (s.card : WithTop ℕ) := Finset.min_le h_mem\\n  cases heq : img.min with\\n  | top =>\\n    rw [heq] at h_min_le\\n    contradiction\\n  | coe m =>\\n    have : (m : WithTop ℕ) ≤ (s.card : WithTop ℕ) := by\\n      rw [heq] at h_min_le\\n      exact h_min_le\\n    have h_le : m ≤ s.card := WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp this\\n    show (some m : Option ℕ).getD 0 ≤ s.card\\n    exact h_le\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_40a99333\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Testing minCard_le in scratch.lean\"","toolSummary":"\"Check minCard_le lemma\""}}]}
{"step_index":216,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:04:44Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T17:04:44+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 20485ef0-711d-400c-81e2-08b9efc4fee8/task-216\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\n\ntheorem minCard_le {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (p : Finset V → Prop) [DecidablePred p] (s : Finset V) (hs : p s) :\n    GraphCalc.minCard p ≤ s.card := by\n  unfold GraphCalc.minCard\n  let img := ((Finset.univ.powerset.filter p).image Finset.card)\n  have h_mem : s.card ∈ img := by\n    apply Finset.mem_image.mpr\n    refine ⟨s, ?_, rfl⟩\n    apply Finset.mem_filter.mpr\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_powerset.mpr (Finset.subset_univ s), hs⟩\n  have h_min_le : img.min ≤ (s.card : WithTop ℕ) := Finset.min_le h_mem\n  cases heq : img.min with\n  | top =>\n    rw [heq] at h_min_le\n    contradiction\n  | coe m =>\n    have : (m : WithTop ℕ) ≤ (s.card : WithTop ℕ) := by\n      rw [heq] at h_min_le\n      exact h_min_le\n    have h_le : m ≤ s.card := WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp this\n    show (some m : Option ℕ).getD 0 ≤ s.card\n    exact h_le\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.ZeDW8w/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/20485ef0-711d-400c-81e2-08b9efc4fee8/.system_generated/tasks/task-216.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
